{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "90b",
 "name": "Ratha Sewers",
 "file": "Map90b_Ratha_Sewers.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Narrow Pipe","descriptions":["Water flows in from the north, falling into a hole in the floor leading straight down.  Iron rungs have been fastened to one wall of the dark pit, forming a slippery ladder.  The constant moisture has ensured that the rungs are well-rusted, in some places pulling out from the wall."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"climb","move":"climb hole"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":40,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Narrow Pipe","descriptions":["The walls are narrowly within a dagger stroke to either side, curving seamlessly into the ceiling and barely giving enough room to stand upright.  Along the center of the floor a stream of dark water flows south."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":1,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":40,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Grate","descriptions":["A fitful light filters through the bars of the grate overhead, and the air is unpleasant with odors probably best not identified.  The walls and floor of the cramped space are built out of tightly fitted stone.  A thin sheet of water flows southward down its center into a large pipe, just big enough to squeeze into."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow pipe"},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":"go polished grate"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Shh'o'kumu Terrace, Nadamian Avenue","descriptions":["The walkways here become expansive plazas lined with potted trees and assorted floral finery.  Exclusive merchants are often seen setting up impromptu shops on this spot, offering strolling residents and servants a chance to partake of their delightful offerings.","The walkways here become expansive plazas lined with potted trees and assorted floral finery.  All is quiet now, an occasional sweep sauntering by intent on ridding the area of unsightly refuse."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"polished grate"}],"linksTo":"Map91_Ratha_Third_Fourth_Tier.xml"},
  {"id":5,"x":40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["A chill wind brushes by, blowing softly past from the black-throated tunnels stretching off in several directions.  The rusted rungs of a ladder climb the north wall, disappearing into a narrow hole cut into the ceiling from which a constant stream of water falls to the floor.  From a distance can be heard soft rustlings and movements, but from which direction, or whether from all directions at once, is impossible to tell."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":8,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":6,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1,"exit":"climb","move":"climb iron ladder"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["Water falling from a line of pipes along the wall echoes unbearably loudly in the almost total darkness.  The noise and lack of light make it difficult to either see or hear anything approaching until it is virtually next to you."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["The atmosphere is icy cold, and tendrils of chill air seem to reach under clothing as if seeking warm flesh to feed upon.  The light is very dim, and the walls of the tunnel are lost in shadowy darkness."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":40,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Tunnels","descriptions":["The tunnel walls have been built of a random mixture of brick and stone, as though the builders utilized whatever came to their hands at that moment.  A small heap of bricks, stone, and dirt has fallen from the ceiling in one place, exposing raw dirt.  The stability of the rest of the ceiling seems questionable."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":9,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":40,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["A light flickers to the southwest, its beams reflecting off the damp stones of the passage.  Compared to the black tunnels, no long night's dawn could be more welcome than this faint glimmer."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":12,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":21,"y":119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snailway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the east is flanked by flaring torches in bronze holders shaped like lions' heads.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":11,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":40,"y":138,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["A red glow flickers in the distance to the northwest.  Its light lends a sense of motion and distance, and dispels the oppressive feeling that the walls are closing in.  The light, obviously from flames, wavers -- growing brighter one moment, dimmer the next."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":59,"y":119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":15,"exit":"none","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":41,"y":119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Snail Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with red tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":20,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":59,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":80,"y":119,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":14,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":16,"exit":"none","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":80,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["A large circular opening -- curiously shaped like a big pipe -- dominates the ceiling of the room.  From the southeast comes the light of flickering torches, contrasting sharply with the darkness to the northeast."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":19,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":100,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":18,"x":120,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["The dim beams from the southwest, gleaming weakly on wet brick and rough walls, reveal three ominously dark entrances to the room.  They stand like the gaping mouths of monsters into whose gullet one would not willingly travel."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":28,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":27,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":17,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":100,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferretway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the north is flanked by flaring torches in iron holders shaped like trolls' hands.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":18,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":100,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Ferret Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with green tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":13,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":21,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":54,"y":226,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beetle Hollow","descriptions":["A few glowing wicks in wall niches cast dim light and dark shadows in a circular room lined with yellow tiles.  From an opening in the ceiling big enough for a wagon, an occasional drop of water splashes to the floor.  It trickles over to a matching hole in the floor and runs down the steeply sloping channel."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":20,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":34,"y":226,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetleway","descriptions":["The tunnel broadens into a kind of anteroom where more care than usual has been taken to dress and smooth the walls and floor.  The opening to the east is flanked by flaring torches in brass holders shaped like trader logs.  It appears to pierce some kind of thick stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":25,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":54,"y":206,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["The tunnel turns at odd angles and disturbing slants, as if it were avoiding rooms rather than connecting them.  A glimmer from the southwest promises clearer vision, but the shadows to the southeast might be nearer the reality of the Warren."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":22,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":74,"y":226,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":25,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":23,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":54,"y":246,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["The tunnel turns at odd angles and disturbing slants, a distorted mirror-image -- if stone can be called a mirror -- of the room to the north.  Torchlight flickers to the northwest, while the darkness waits at two other yawning entrances."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":22,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":74,"y":266,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"none","move":"north"},{"to":25,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":120,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":18,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":140,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":31,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":49,"exit":"none","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":140,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":32,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":27,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":49,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":180,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the chill of a clammy breeze or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":32,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":29,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":33,"exit":"none","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":180,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":"go obscure opening"},{"to":40,"exit":"none","move":"down"},{"to":32,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":28,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":30,"exit":"none","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":160,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":31,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":29,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":180,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something silent brushing past or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"none","move":"down"},{"to":34,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":140,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":35,"exit":"none","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":120,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Snail Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":34,"exit":"none","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":100,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Grating","descriptions":["A faint light from the grating above shows this small, tile-lined room, hardly more than a wide connection in the system of pipes that regulates the flow of water that cleanses and refreshes Ratha.  A big bronze valve is the only noteworthy feature in the place."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go sewer grating"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":37,"x":100,"y":72,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Eastern Promenade","descriptions":["The travel-worn road narrows, and the caravans that frequent it tangle in the crowded way.  Camels snort, donkeys bray and traders curse in the congestion as they all push for a place at the marble watering trough at the side of the road."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"sewer grating"}],"linksTo":"Map91_Ratha_Third_Fourth_Tier.xml"},
  {"id":38,"x":220,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Drain","descriptions":["Beneath the drain is a small, tile-lined room, part of the main sewer and water supply system, from the look of the big bronze valve that takes up most of one wall of the room."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go obscure opening"},{"to":39,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded drain"}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":39,"x":240,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Ratha Bazaar, Grand Pavilion","descriptions":["Fabulous marble colonnades line a regal plaza of tremendous proportions.  Elegant fountains flow in a series down the exact center of the pavilion and provide a sparkling backdrop for enormous pots of ornamental palms and brilliant flowers.  Throngs of merchants and visitors mill about in the grand foyer of the Ratha Bazaar, waiting to reconcile bills of lading or gain entrance into the festive marketplace."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":"go gilded drain"}],"linksTo":"Map90_Ratha_First_Second_Tier.xml"},
  {"id":40,"x":180,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a feathery, sticky strand or the tang of the salt sea becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"none","move":"up"},{"to":41,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"none","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":200,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a continual dripping breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":42,"exit":"none","move":"south"},{"to":46,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":200,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the touch of a drop of water -- surely it's water? -- or a pungent, spicy aroma becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only what might be a footstep breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":41,"exit":"none","move":"north"},{"to":45,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"},{"to":43,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":220,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or the smell of fish, fresh and otherwise, becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a sound like a sigh breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":44,"exit":"none","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":240,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: something noiselessly brushing past or an odd whiff of incense becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow passage"},{"to":46,"exit":"none","move":"west"},{"to":45,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"},{"to":43,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":220,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the slip of a loose brick underfoot or the reek of mold long in the making becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only an occasional splash breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"none","move":"southwest"},{"to":44,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":220,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Beetle Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only a low-pitched rumble breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"none","move":"east"},{"to":41,"exit":"none","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":260,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, Beneath the Drain","descriptions":["The sewer drop under the grating is a small, tile-lined room.  Rainwater from the street above flows into it and exits through a big bronze valve that seems oversized for that purpose."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go passage"},{"to":48,"exit":"go","move":"go broken grating"},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go bronze valve","hidden":true}],"color":"#00FF00"},
  {"id":48,"x":279,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Ratha, Blind Alley","descriptions":["A wall of refuse brings an end to travel along this alley.  Rats, mice and neighborhood cats frequent the area in search of pungent victuals.  A broken door lies against the remains of a crumbling fence that partially covers a broken sewer grating."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"linksTo":"Map90_Ratha_First_Second_Tier.xml"},
  {"id":49,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"The Sewers, The Ferret Warren","descriptions":["In the darkness, senses other than sight press for attention: the feel of soft, yielding mud or the stench of refuse and worse becomes ominous when eyesight fails and only the click of claws on stone breaks the silence."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"none","move":"southeast"},{"to":17,"exit":"none","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":320,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Ehhrsk Highway","descriptions":["Green lichen growing on the walls glows with an eerie light, providing a small amount of illumination.  The darkness makes one part of the tunnels look the same as the rest.  A faint reek of sewage fills the air, but the area is clean of everything but a few cobwebs."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":59,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":51,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":300,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Ehhrsk Highway","descriptions":["Green lichen growing on the walls glows with an eerie light, providing a small amount of illumination.  The darkness makes one part of the tunnels look the same as the rest.  A faint reek of sewage fills the air, but the area is clean of everything but a few cobwebs."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":50,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
